    <item>
      <title>Bloooom</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1399/working/bloooom/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 15:49:14 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1399/working/bloooom/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A collaboration platform born from a simple observation: great ideas and great builders rarely find each other.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;cs-metrics&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;cs-metric&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__value&#34;&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__label&#34;&gt;early users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;cs-metric&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__value&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__label&#34;&gt;designer &amp;#43; developer (me)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;cs-metric&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__value&#34;&gt;2023&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;cs-metric__label&#34;&gt;built post-ChatGPT&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;cs-button external&#34; href=&#34;https://bloooom.vercel.app&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span&gt;View live product&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;cs-button__icon&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;↗&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;the-opportunity&#34;&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;ai-made-it-possible-for-me-to-design-and-build-products-end-to-end&#34;&gt;AI made it possible for me to design and build products end to end&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This project started in 2023, right after ChatGPT became widely available. It felt like a turning point. As a designer, I suddenly had the ability to take an idea all the way from concept to a working product without depending on someone else to build it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
